---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Base title="About" description="Background, skills and what I work on." image="/og/about.png">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Sudharsan, a data scientist who builds end-to-end data products, from pipelines and warehouse models to
    dashboards people use to make decisions. My most recent project is a
    <a href="/projects/hdb-resale-pipeline/">public pipeline on Singapore resale housing data</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    I started out at an analytics firm, solving problems for Fortune 500 clients in e-commerce, retail and financial
    services. I then completed a Master's in Business Analytics at the National University of Singapore, where my team
    won the 2017 NUS Business Analytics Innovation Challenge.
  </p>
  <p>
    I work across the full lifecycle: scoping a problem, getting and cleaning data, modelling, and putting it into
    production. My recent stack is Python, SQL, dbt, BigQuery and Terraform, alongside R and the cloud platforms I've used
    (GCP and AWS). I'm most interested in data engineering and analytics engineering, natural language processing, and
    time series forecasting.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside work I play tennis, watch football and backpack to far-flung places. I've also volunteered my analytics
    skills with an NGO that uses data for women's safety.
  </p>
  <p>
    I like learning from people. If you want to talk data, tennis or football, find me on
    <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>{SITE.linkedin && <> or <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></>}. The work shown on
    this site uses public data only.
  </p>
</Base>
